ADDENDA <Act No. 20553, Dec. 3, 2024>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force one year after the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Applicability to formulation of establishment management plans)
The amended provisions of Article 6(2) shall begin to apply to establishment management plans formulated after this Act enters into force.
Article 3 (Relationships to other statutes and regulations)
A citation of any previous provisions by other statutes or regulations in force as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed a citation of the relevant provisions of this Act in lieu of such previous provisions, if corresponding provisions exist herein.
